  "description": "AWS Bedrock bring-your-own-key adapter for Tamp.Conformance. A thin IChatCompletion shim over the Bedrock Runtime InvokeModel API for Anthropic (Claude) models, with hand-rolled SigV4 request signing (no AWS SDK dependency). Credentials are read from the standard AWS environment variables and never emitted; the region is configurable. Lets ADR rule extraction and semantic conformance checks run against Claude on Bedrock — including GovCloud regions.",
